###############################################################################
# PART D - security
###############################################################################

### 401: no token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001

### 401: malformed / tampered token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001
Authorization: Bearer not.a.valid-token

### 401: expired token (run "short-lived Courier token" above, wait over a minute, then run this)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001
Authorization: Bearer {{shortLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 200: valid token, any role may read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 403: Courier may not delete (Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}

### 403: Admin may not upload scans (Courier only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scans":[{"scanId":"scan::9d2b3c4d-0000-4000-8000-000000000009","scanType":"Pickup","courierId":"courier-demo-01","location":"Depot","scannedAtUtc":"2026-11-10T08:00:00Z"}]}

### 403: Admin may not PATCH status (Courier only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/APX-20000001/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"InTransit"}

### Partner 200: valid X-Api-Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-20000001
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}

### Partner 401: missing X-Api-Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-20000001

### Partner 401: invalid X-Api-Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-20000001
X-Api-Key: wrong-key

### Partner 404: valid key, unknown shipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/partner/shipments/APX-00000000
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}

### 404 ProblemDetails: tracking number in the wrong format does not match any route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/shipments/ABC-1
Authorization: Bearer {{courierToken}}
